  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two storey extension by reason of its mass, scaling, and design, would result in an over scaled and incongruous development which fails to appear subordinate to the host dwelling and that would infill an important gap in the streetscape, thereby resulting in less than substantial harm to the character and appearance of the Building of Townscape Merit and the CA15 Kew Gardens Conservation Area. There is not sufficient public benefit to outweigh this harm. As such, the proposals would not comply with the NPPF, policies LP1, LP3 and LP4 of the Richmond Local Plan (2018) and policies 28, 29 and 30 of the Publication Local Plan as supported by the CA15 Kew Gardens Conservation Area Statement."
